# Editor / OS transient files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*.bak
*~

# Configuration locale d'un lecteur Markdown (Obsidian) et snapshots de son
# plugin Git : propres a chaque poste, jamais publies (depot public). Le vault
# ne versionne aucune configuration d'outil (ADR-126).
.obsidian/
_backups/

# Vault-specific transient outputs
#
# `weekly-vault-lint` (ADR-020) writes a snapshot of detected orphans into
# `99-meta/orphans-report.md` at run-time. This file is transient — it
# captures the working-tree state at lint-time, which can include files from
# a checked-out feature branch that don't exist on `main`. Committing it
# would create stale, misleading reports.
#
# Canonical, timestamped reports go in `99-meta/reports/YYYY-MM-*.md` (e.g.
# `99-meta/reports/2026-04-signature-audit.md`). The lint should be updated
# to write there instead — see Q4 trigger in PR description.
99-meta/orphans-report.md

# Sync log artifacts (regenerated each sync)
99-meta/last-sync-timestamp.tmp

# Python bytecode (never commit)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
